    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Production runbook",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Recommended production checks\n\n- **Availability:** `up` must remain `1`; investigate readiness and deployment events when it drops.\n- **Errors:** alert when HTTP 5xx exceeds 2% for five minutes.\n- **Latency:** alert on P95/P99 only after enabling request histograms.\n- **Resources:** alert when heap exceeds 85%, process CPU exceeds 80%, or Hikari pending connections remain above zero.\n- **Telemetry:** use Grafana Explore for OTLP logs and traces; this dashboard is for Prometheus metrics.\n\nThe P95/P99 panels require `management.metrics.distribution.percentiles-histogram.http.server.requests=true`."
      }
    },
